<title>SINGAPORE: SIMEX Brent steady after overnight decline.</title>
<headline>SIMEX Brent steady after overnight decline.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>August Brent futures were steady on SIMEX on Thursday, helped by a modest rebound in NYMEX prices after overnight falls both sides of the Atlantic, brokers said.</p>
<p>August Brent was quoted at $18.20/$18.34 per barrel after London fell 16 to $18.22.</p>
<p>NYMEX August was last traded on ACCESS at $19.50 per barrel, up four cents from New York.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
